  (text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 - JST GH 15P\nSame part and pinout as ControlBoard2027 J9; straight 1:1 cable, 26 AWG.\n1-2 +3V3_HOST, GND on both sides of SCK/MOSI/MISO/CS, 12 HANDSHAKE, 13 DATA_READY, 14 EN, 15 GND.\nControlboard pull-ups/downs: CS pull-up (R29), HANDSHAKE/DATA_READY pull-downs (R31/R32).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §5."
    (at 152.4 204.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e61fdadd-b5b3-4d02-87be-afc297ce9027")
  )
